<title>Pakistan and Afghanistan: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/afghanistan-pakistan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-afghanistan-pakistan-2026-11-21T11:30:01.958Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 11:30:01 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Pakistani security forces killed three terrorists, including the mastermind of the Kohat police lines attack, in an IBO operation, while police in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa stopped a major terror attack in Lakki Marwat, killing a suspected suicide bomber. A minister travelled to India for a SCO meeting, the first ministerial visit since the 2025 war. A shutdown strike halted activity across Balochistan after an ex-minister was found dead in Hafizabad. Separate bus collisions with gas tankers each killed ten civilians. The conflict produced 1,794 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisAFBVV95cUxQUkpCNEVTbUFKSlczUElSN2FYeDN6R2pQZXl6eUEzV1NseHFlOGtESVpNaUJjTnd2dTFPZmdfWVNNSzFISWNFT2YzbzFpTHVIa2dwQlpMbks1YlNOQjVscEdoXzNIRE5CY2RlaUw5WUt5WGhDQjBsc0NsUkpSamdsVk9zb0hLRGt1QTBNcFRRNnFCdkpycDlGckhlVVc1el9uUzZqd2NXdi1BOFo3RkthQw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE1IdVJZX0lzdjVBOGdvc2xzX00wRzhLeE9obXVsS0k2MVRXaEIySm1Jak0tOEVJSTB0UDdnaHRYdlV0cVV0VnRydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiSEFVX3lxTE5TSU9uSkNTVzBUaFlkbDEzWVcyNE11ZGFsUUJrSXQtckRLVDJPN1pmdlpySzY0MGtnNVBiRDFEQ21XUloyaGZWbQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Dawn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQYmtpN21fRWxHVXgyZGlhNTI2dHNXZW0wY3hyc1liS1l2VTZqVzZFa1dRTGNlNjFlX0VpRWxydzA2eVMyNU1nYnV0anBuX0JJMDV0eG92WThhNENua3liOE9wa1NQX3paUUowUmpNaGptX0g3YjJFTmpmTmlobG5qOENuLXVZWVM3NTR4eDBsTTk1NVhqZGQ2cV9MMlMtQ2sxeEFEV0pxZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxOSHZUemlYMDlCUm1Gc1R5OWY5MHd0cGd2a255MEZDck5wRF83TjljYzNNbGEzYXlLekRESzctX0lUZEZRLXNQ